// Title: Clear PowerShell History - PowerShell Module
// ID: f99276ad-d122-4989-a09a-d00904a5f9d2
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Ilyas Ochkov, Jonhnathan Ribeiro, Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
// Date: 2019-10-25
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1070.003
// Description: Detects keywords that could indicate clearing PowerShell history
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((where(Payload ICONTAINS "Set-PSReadlineOption") AND where(Payload ICONTAINS "–HistorySaveStyle") AND where(Payload ICONTAINS "SaveNothing"))) OR ((where(Payload ICONTAINS "Set-PSReadlineOption") AND where(Payload ICONTAINS "-HistorySaveStyle") AND where(Payload ICONTAINS "SaveNothing")))) OR (((where(Payload ICONTAINS "del") OR where(Payload ICONTAINS "Remove-Item") OR where(Payload ICONTAINS "rm"))) AND (where(Payload ICONTAINS "(Get-PSReadlineOption).HistorySavePath"))))
